{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_st03",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_st03",
  "title": "Under the Gun",
  "storyCode": "OF-ST3",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8048c0086f97393ab5c6295c8df6e1ce12fe3ac0f3a90ec9a157a7e9ac343ece",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "...Would you be able to walk around a bit with me, Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I'm a little worried about you.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Doctor, did you know? When I was a child, this beach wasn't this busy. I used to like making sand castles by myself."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "...This city is getting better and better every year, thanks to my father."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "My father and I, well, don't talk a lot."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "I've always wondered... Which is more important, this city and the wealth it brings, or me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "My mother died when she gave birth to me. Sometimes I think about if that's the reason why he doesn't like me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "And it feels like he doesn't care if I like him or not. Ever since I can remember, he has rarely been at home because of business. Rather than father and daughter, we're more like two strangers living under the same roof."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Schwarz, I want to go observe the ecosystem of the beach!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "You mustn't, milady. Master Doykos said you must not go outside without good reason."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#1",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "But I'm tired of reading the same old books here! Schwarz, you're no fun at all!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "My apologies, milady. This is for your safety though; it's dangerous outside."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "But won't you be with me? Are you going to put me in danger?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Of course I wouldn't."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "So, what's the problem then? Let's go!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...In that case, please do not stray from my sight."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "One could say that back then, having Schwarz at my side just felt like a simple fact of life."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Male Civilian",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Hurry up, these ornaments are for tonight's concert."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Male Civilian",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We'll be in trouble if we don't make it on time!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Oh, that's..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "If I remember properly, he's the grandson of the owner of the Mockingbird Café on Second Avenue."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "I used to go there a lot. The old storekeeper was a kind man. His wife had already passed away at that time, so he decorated the café with her favorite flowers and bonsai trees, and put on their favorite music."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "But he did say that he was getting too old to run the shop, and would pass the business over to his grandson."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Time sure flies."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Why's that?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "Because I have Oripathy, milady."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "It's bad for your health to come too close to me. Please call upon me only when it is necessary."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "What's that? Does it hurt?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...It doesn't hurt, but, I will die because of it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "There is no cure for this disease, milady."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "And..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "I just have to find the cure then!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Heh, just you wait! One day, I'll defeat that illness, and snatch you back from its jaws!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "The reason I became an Originium researcher was because of her. I wanted to cure her."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "That has always been the thing motivating me. I even went to Victoria to pursue this dream."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "However, Originium research is very difficult. At the beginning, I couldn't even grasp the basic concepts and felt like giving up. But I persevered."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Victoria is also very far away, and I couldn't get used to it at first."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "But now, I feel like I'm more of a Victorian than a Siestan."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Doctor, could it be said that everything I have is an illusion?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "I'm willing to pay anything to protect this place."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I don't know.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Ceylon",
              "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
              "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
              "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
              "text": "Hmm... I suppose so. There's no way you'd be able to know."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "She might be struggling too.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Ceylon",
              "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
              "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
              "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
              "text": "Then what is it? Something she can't even tell me about?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Ceylon",
              "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
              "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
              "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
              "text": "Besides, no matter what she's struggling with, that much is inevitable because of the sins she has committed."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Doctor, do you think I should give up?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I can't answer that for you...",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But you are a true Originium researcher.",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Can we vanquish Oripathy?\nCan we save the Infected?\nWill there be an end to these tribulations?\nIf there is, I can't see it. I'm not sure. I don't know how to answer.\nCan I just give up? Yes.\nBut I don't want to."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Perhaps the land we've been born into is blighted...",
          "value": "5",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But the things that you've done have not been in vain.",
          "value": "6",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Believe in the choices you've made.",
          "value": "7",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Phew... You're right, Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Your experience really shows. Looks like I still have a lot to learn."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "First, I need to stop being sentimental and start by finding the proof."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "If they are really putting citizens in danger on purpose, I'll do everything in my power to stop them!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Because I believe in my own decisions, I'll fight to save this city, even if nobody else will!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "Well said."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Oh, Mister Hellagur!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "By the looks of things, you've found your answer."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Mhm. Mister Hellagur, Doctor, could you hear me out?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "No matter what, I don't want to see the citizens being put into danger. That's my number one priority. The largest broadcast tower here is located by the Garrison Amusement Park."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "It controls this city's entire broadcast system."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "The broadcast tower?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "However, it's controlled by Cronin's henchmen. He often appears there to speak to the citizens."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "When the major concert begins, everyone's going to be gathered by the stage. Cronin's men are going to be have their hands full trying to keep things orderly."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "As long as we control the tower at that time, we can spread the news throughout the whole city."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "So, I'm asking both of you, please lend me your aid!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
